<lb n="10"/>uß dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gotts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">huß</unclear>, in ainer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechts</unclear> fertung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betreffende</unclear> ains
